# ==============================================================================
# VISAAPPLY.ORG — GITHUB CODEOWNERS (PHASE 6 / 6.1 EDITORIAL GOVERNANCE)
# Enforces domain-specific human reviewer approval via GitHub Branch Protection.
#
# CRITICAL GITHUB ENFORCEMENT NOTES:
# 1. Replace `@visaapply-org/*` with your real GitHub Organization slug if the
#    repository is hosted under a different GitHub Organization name.
# 2. Every listed team MUST exist in that GitHub Organization AND have explicit
#    Write (or Maintain/Admin) access to this repository, or GitHub ignores the rule.
# 3. Multiple teams on one line act as logical OR (any ONE team member approves).
#    Therefore, high-risk statutory, quarantine, source-registry, governance,
#    public catalog, and CI paths are strictly restricted to Senior Immigration
#    Reviewers and/or Platform Admins (never Country Editors or Evidence Reviewers).
# 4. `@visaapply-org/read-only-auditors` is intentionally omitted (zero approval rights).
# 5. Repository Branch Protection / Ruleset MUST enable "Require review from Code Owners".
# ==============================================================================

# Default fallback owner — guarantees zero unowned files anywhere in the repository
*                                     @visaapply-org/platform-admins

# High-risk immigration law, eligibility, visa details, quarantine & verification claims
/data/programs/                       @visaapply-org/senior-immigration-reviewers @visaapply-org/platform-admins
